  m_Name: Note_SpectralModulator2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Spectral Modulator Location
  key: 27
  topic: 1
  boardContentText: Spectral modulation could be controlled from the abandoned research
    station
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: "They ignore me. As if I were a ghost.\nThe ship was supposed to come
    a week ago. Still nothing. No one answers \u2014 not the radio, not even a greeting.
    And they keep building their mad experiments. They work at night. Vogel is with
    them.\nI cannot explain it. We have worked here together for a long time. We
    were friends. And now, suddenly, it's as if I do not exist. It is so strange.\n<page>\nSomething
    is happening here. It is unsettling.\nI have discovered one thing. The spectral
    modulation can be controlled from the abandoned research station. It is still
    operational. Will they find me, if they discover that?\n\u2014 Dr. Kellerstein"
  paperSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cea3c49c6ad23de4286197f5004fc48e, type: 3}
